# The one image built from the repository's root is the converter sidecar's
# (deploy/converter/Dockerfile): only the Go module it builds from goes into its context, and the
# go.mod of each module that module replaces with a directory.
*
!server/
!docs/api/go.mod
!packages/i18n/go.mod
!reference-data/go.mod
server/**/testdata/
server/*.exe
